# > Backpack Exchange & Wallet 全终端覆盖 (Web / iOS / Android)

# 1. User-Agent 规则：精准捕获 iOS/Android App 客户端流量
USER-AGENT,Backpack*
USER-AGENT,*backpack*

# 2. 域名后缀规则：匹配 Web 端网页、底层 API 接口及相关生态
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,backpack.exchange
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,backpack.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xnft.gg
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coral.community

# 3. 关键字规则：兜底拦截，覆盖可能遗漏的静态资源 CDN 
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,backpack
